# --- ancestry pipeline ---
# The frozen discovery tables are deliberately NOT in this repository. This repository is
# public; the tables are aggregates of UK Biobank, MHI and CLSA participants (including
# meta-analysis allele frequencies), and whether they may be released is a data-access
# question. They ship under reference/ in the pinned ancestry model snapshot instead,
# so one access grant covers the weights and the numbers they are compared against.
#
# Only MANIFEST.txt (fingerprints, which disclose nothing) and the two builders are tracked.
# Everything else in that directory is ignored so that a working copy of the tables sitting
# there -- which is the normal state on a development machine -- can never be committed.
ancestry/reference/*
!ancestry/reference/MANIFEST.txt
!ancestry/reference/README.md
!ancestry/reference/_build_reference.py
!ancestry/reference/_build_external_reference.py
work/
results/
ancestry/reference/__pycache__/
*.sbatch
